2a:T8a5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why choose Flutter for custom mobile application development over native Swift and Kotlin?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Flutter compiles directly to native ARM machine code using Google’s Impeller rendering engine, ensuring silky 60fps to 120fps animations. Choosing Flutter allows you to share over 95% of your codebase between iOS and Android. This drastically slashes development costs, speeds up time-to-market, and prevents feature parity bugs between platforms."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do Flutter apps feel truly native to iOS and Android users?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Flutter allows adaptive widget rendering that automatically matches platform idioms—such as Cupertino navigation bars on iPhones and Material 3 transitions on Android. Users cannot distinguish a meticulously engineered Flutter app from one built in pure Swift or Kotlin."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you handle the entire Apple App Store and Google Play review process?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, completely. I configure your Apple Developer and Google Play Console accounts, set up cryptographic distribution certificates and provisioning profiles, write App Store privacy declarations, prepare marketing screenshots, and resolve any feedback or guidelines questions from Apple reviewers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you handle backend integration and API communication?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I connect Flutter apps to custom Django, Node.js, or Firebase backends using typed API repositories, interceptors for JWT token refreshes, and automatic request caching. If you do not yet have a backend, I can engineer your server APIs concurrently."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens when Apple or Google release new OS versions?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Because Flutter is maintained actively by Google and backed by an enormous global ecosystem, major iOS and Android updates are supported immediately. I build with clean, decoupled state architectures that make future SDK bumps simple and stress-free."}}]}18:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2a"}}]
